        "TileImage": "$($repository 3845f48e-20f4-407f-8550-30a5ff32f6e5).Image",
        "Description": "Reginald Gibson, a bodyguard for hire who serves those who have deep enough pockets to not care to spend a little extra for the best in the business. Here, he is now in service to one &quot;Kalvin Ritter&quot;, he will be found outside of Ritter&apos;s private office. Reginald has word of one of our informants and  if he gets the word out my political carear is ruined. I trust you know what you&apos;re doing 47, Good luck\rYours sincerely,\rMr Larkin",
